WEBVTT

00:00.220 --> 00:02.540
When several cards share a component,

00:02.620 --> 00:05.020
use the page picker to select the one you mean.

00:07.120 --> 00:09.360
Open Copy component context.

00:09.600 --> 00:12.800
The React key identifies the Design system card.

00:13.100 --> 00:14.780
To include a live value,

00:14.980 --> 00:18.300
enter project.progress and choose Include prop.

00:18.920 --> 00:20.840
The preview now shows 72.

00:21.320 --> 00:23.880
Copy the text and paste it beside your request

00:23.960 --> 00:26.520
so the agent knows which label to change.
